- Hmm, I really thought that
last "or else" would've worked.
- 嗯，我真的这么认为
最后一个“否则”就可以了。

08:38.344 --> 08:40.965
Maybe I should've
wagged my finger.
也许我应该
摇动我的手指。

08:41.000 --> 08:43.724
- [snoring]
- [打鼾]

08:43.758 --> 08:50.586
