- Ah!
- Right on time.
- 啊！
- 准时。

08:57.137 --> 09:01.103
Looks like I won't be needing
you after all, SpongeTom.
看来我不需要
毕竟是你，海绵汤姆。

09:01.137 --> 09:03.068
- Oh.
- 哦。

09:03.103 --> 09:06.551
♪
