- Sadly, it looks like your
order's on time today.
- 可悲的是，它看起来像你的
今天订单准时。

09:49.000 --> 09:50.620
- [giggles]
- [咯咯笑]

09:50.655 --> 09:52.310
[bell rings]
D'oh!
[铃声响起]
噢！

09:52.344 --> 09:54.034
- [gleeful groans]
- [高兴的呻吟声]

09:54.068 --> 09:57.827
Glad you finally
woke up on time, boyo.
很高兴你终于
准时起床，博约。

09:57.862 --> 10:00.310
[laughs]
[笑]

10:00.344 --> 10:01.379
[bell rings]
[铃声响起]

10:01.413 --> 10:05.310
