- What in Poseidon's beard?
- 波塞冬的胡子里有什么？

10:44.172 --> 10:46.724
- [gasps]
Oh. Oh.
- [喘气]
哦。哦。

10:46.758 --> 10:48.482
Good morning, Mr. Krabs.
早上好，蟹老板。

10:48.517 --> 10:50.586
- It's not a good morning.
- 这不是一个美好的早晨。

10:50.620 --> 10:52.517
First, you're late for days,
首先，你迟到了几天，

10:52.551 --> 10:56.034
and now you destroyed
me kitchen.
现在你毁了
我的厨房。

10:56.068 --> 10:57.137
- [laughs nervously]
- [紧张地笑]

10:57.172 --> 10:59.758
- Oh, looks like it's--
- 哦，看起来是——

10:59.793 --> 11:02.896
- Time for "or else?"
- 是时候说“否则？”

11:02.931 --> 11:06.241
[dramatic music]
- You better be at work on time
[戏剧音乐]
- 你最好准时上班

11:06.275 --> 11:08.827
or else I'll have to open up
不然我就得敞开心扉

11:08.862 --> 11:11.172
and close the restaurant
an hour later.
并关闭餐厅
一个小时后。

11:11.206 --> 11:12.758
- Uh, what?
- 呃，什么？

11:12.793 --> 11:14.758
No!
不！

11:14.793 --> 11:16.551
[door slams open]
- [grunts]
[门砰地一声打开]
- [咕哝]

11:16.586 --> 11:19.482
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

11:19.517 --> 11:21.551
I did it.
我做到了。

11:21.586 --> 11:23.758
- [gasps]
Yes!
- [喘气]
是的！

11:23.793 --> 11:26.103
Oh, Patrick, you fixed it.
哦，帕特里克，你修好了。

11:26.137 --> 11:28.137
- Uh, kind of.
- 呃，有点。

11:28.172 --> 11:30.000
[bubbling]
[冒泡]

11:30.034 --> 11:31.655
- [snoring]
- [打鼾]

